OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as 280 more homes planned
OL,4,Afor market town
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew-build houses are overcrowding a
OL,7,Fmarket town, according to people living
OL,8,Fthere.
OL,10,FTheir concerns comes as an application
OL,11,Fto build up to 280 homes on
OL,12,Fagricultural fields in Whitchurch,
OL,13,FShropshire, has been put in by
OL,14,Fdevelopers Richborough.
OL,16,FVal Sweeney, who lives in the town,
OL,17,Fsaid is among those worried at the
OL,18,Fplans and "cannot logistically think"
OL,19,Fwhy more houses could be built on the
OL,20,Fsite when there was "already another
OL,21,Fsite about a mile away that is not
OL,22,Fbeing completed or sold".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
